rticular discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":276,"player":2,"text":"The discovery is not a method, it is a posture. Walk as though you have every right to be there and are faintly bored of being there, and people will look directly at you and later be quite certain the room was empty.","kind":"info"},{"turn":276,"player":2,"text":"Now available: Nobody, Intelligencer, Hollow-caste, Off The Books, The Unreturned.","kind":"good"},{"turn":276,"player":2,"text":"Research begins: A Shape That Waits.","kind":"research"},{"turn":277,"player":0,"text":"Two Axethrowers throws its axe at Knight.","kind":"combat","cue":"axe-throw","at":[34,27],"actor":236},{"turn":277,"player":0,"text":"Two Axethrowers defeats Knight after 23 rounds.","kind":"combat","at":[34,27],"actor":236},{"turn":277,"player":1,"text":"Knight is wiped out.","kind":"bad","at":[34,27]},{"turn":277,"player":0,"text":"Two Axethrowers picks its axe back up off the corpse.","kind":"good","cue":"promote","at":[34,26]},{"turn":277,"player":1,"text":"Highmarch completes Chapel of Mild Optimism.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":277,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch completes Hall of Careful Notes.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":277,"player":2,"text":"The Hive That Is Adequate grows to 7.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":277,"player":3,"text":"Wanderer finishes a road.","kind":"good","at":[41,29]},{"turn":277,"player":3,"text":"The Agreed Meeting Point has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":277,"player":3,"text":"Wanderer finishes the road: there is nothing left to lay that way.","kind":"good","at":[41,29]},{"turn":278,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":278,"player":1,"text":"Two Archers holds against Two Axethrowers.","kind":"combat","at":[35,27],"actor":236},{"turn":278,"player":0,"text":"Two Axethrowers is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[34,26]},{"turn":278,"player":0,"text":"All 2 of them, at once. The Bleeding Skull